# SYNOPSIS: feat-1-per-cu-itr-directories
# TIMESTAMP: 2026-10-09

FEATURES_IMPLEMENTED=feat-1-per-cu-itr-directories
MAX_ATTEMPTS=3
DTR=.LLMDD/DTRS/feat-1-per-cu-itr-directories/itr-compiler.dtr
BATCH=batch.json
CUS=cu-001,cu-002,cu-003,cu-004,cu-005
ENFORCED_BY=itr-compiler
SUMMARY.1=Extend the itr-compiler so every regular CU compiles into its own cu-<id>/ subdirectory holding COORDINATES.itr, REQUIREMENTS.itr, IMPLEMENTATION_STEPS.itr and ACCEPTANCE.itr, with ARCH.itr/LEGEND.itr kept global at the ITR root.
SUMMARY.2=Compilation fails with a relevant error naming the CU and the missing piece when any component, the root SYNOPSIS.itr, MAX_ATTEMPTS, or this implementation summary is absent; Advisor-placed per-CU overrides are accepted without content enforcement.
SUMMARY.3=Coders implement from IMPLEMENTATION_STEPS.itr, verify against per-CU ACCEPTANCE.itr (including regression tests), and retry until MAX_ATTEMPTS before escalating to the code lead.
